  m_text: "Military jacket (1) in sage green wool fabric. \nThe jacket has a lapel
    collar and closes at the center front with a double row of \nmetal buttons (ten
    in total). Each button features three crowns \n(the Swedish coat of arms). The
    shoulders feature epaulettes that fasten with \na metal button. Both front panels
    have a braided pocket with a flap. The\n jacket has long, set-in sleeves with
    a wide, stitched cuff. \nThere is a slit at the center back that is closed with
    two buttons. On the\n back, there is a belt (2) at the waist that is fastened
    with two metal buttons.\n The jacket is lined with cotton up to the waist."
